<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>atablefor — a Kiosk restaurant-booking endpoint (demo)</title>
  <!-- Machine-readable affordance: assistants discover the Kiosk surface here.
       The href is the VERSIONED cut this operator pins, read from
       Kiosk.configuration.skill_url — the SAME url the `skill` block of
       /.well-known/kiosk.json carries, never the mutable skill.md alias
       (K-927). One immutable, hash-pinnable file behind both signals, and
       one place to re-pin: the initializer. -->
  <link rel="kiosk" href="<%= Kiosk.configuration.skill_url %>">
  <style>
    :root{--accent:#8a3b1c;--accent2:#ffcf9b;--ink:#2a1a12;--muted:#98847a;--soft:#f7e6da;--line:#eccbb2;--bg:#faf6f2;--ok:#1a6b3c}
    *,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
    body{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:var(--bg);line-height:1.5}
    a{color:var(--accent)}
    header{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:0 32px;height:60px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    .logo{font-size:22px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.5px}
    .logo span{color:var(--accent2)}
    header nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;font-size:13px}
    header nav a{color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;opacity:.92}
    header nav a:hover{opacity:1;text-decoration:underline}
    .staff-login{background:rgba(255,255,255,.16);border-radius:8px;padding:6px 13px}
    .signout-btn{background:rgba(255,255,255,.16);border:0;color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;border-radius:8px;padding:6px 13px;cursor:pointer}
    .signout-btn:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.28)}
    .whoami{font-size:12px;opacity:.85}
    .wrap{max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}

    /* ── Agent-facing header strip: first thing an assistant/agent reads ── */
    .agentbar{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font-size:13.5px;padding:9px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .agentbar .tag{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;background:var(--accent2);color:var(--ink);border-radius:999px;padding:3px 10px;white-space:nowrap}
    .agentbar a{color:var(--accent2);font-weight:700}
    .agentbar .what{color:#e0cbbb;font-weight:600}

    /* the loud "this is a machine endpoint" banner — first thing a visitor/agent sees */
    .proto{background:#1c130d;color:#ffe;margin-top:0;padding:26px 24px}
    .proto .wrap{max-width:860px}
    .proto-badge{display:inline-block;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ffcf9b;border:1px solid #6b4a33;border-radius:999px;padding:4px 12px;margin-bottom:12px}
    .proto h1{font-size:24px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:8px}
    .proto p{font-size:15px;color:#e8d9cd;max-width:640px}
    .proto .say{background:#2a1c12;border:1px solid #6b4a33;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;font-size:15.5px;font-weight:600;color:#ffcf9b;margin:14px 0 6px}
    .proto .no-signin{font-size:13px;color:#c9b4a4;margin-top:6px}

    .sec{margin:32px auto 0}
    .sec-k{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px}
    .sec-k::before{content:"";width:18px;height:2px;background:var(--accent);border-radius:2px}

    .tryit{background:#fff;border:2px solid var(--accent);border-radius:16px;padding:22px 24px}
    .tryit h2{font-size:19px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:8px}
    .tryit p{font-size:15px;margin-bottom:10px;color:#432}
    .steps{list-style:none;counter-reset:s;margin:6px 0 4px}
    .steps li{counter-increment:s;font-size:14.5px;color:#432;padding:3px 0 3px 30px;position:relative}
    .steps li::before{content:counter(s);position:absolute;left:0;top:2px;width:21px;height:21px;background:var(--soft);color:var(--accent);border-radius:50%;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
    .note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}
    .linkbox{margin-top:14px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px dashed var(--line);font-size:14px}
    .linkbox a{font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}
    .linkbox a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
    .cred{margin-top:9px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    .cred code{font-family:"SF Mono","Fira Mono",monospace;background:var(--soft);border-radius:6px;padding:2px 7px;color:var(--ink)}

    .about{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:22px 24px}
    .about p{font-size:15px;margin-bottom:13px}
    .chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:15px}
    .chip{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--accent);background:var(--soft);border-radius:999px;padding:5px 12px}
    .links a{display:inline-block;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;margin:0 18px 0 0;text-decoration:none}
    .links a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
    .disco{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:15px 22px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center}
    .disco a{font-weight:600}

    .stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(120px,1fr));gap:10px}
    .stat{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 12px;text-align:center}
    .stat .n{font-size:23px;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent);line-height:1}
    .stat .l{margin-top:5px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}

    /* reservations board */
    .board{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:20px 22px}
    .board-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-bottom:14px}
    .board-title{font-size:17px;font-weight:800}
    .board-sub{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}
    .board-count{flex:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ok);background:#e7f5ec;border-radius:999px;padding:5px 11px;white-space:nowrap}
    .board-empty{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);padding:8px 0}
    .res-list{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
    .res{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:11px 13px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px}
    .res-party{font-weight:800;color:var(--accent);font-size:14px;min-width:78px}
    .res-table{font-weight:700;font-size:14px}
    .res-when{font-size:13.5px;color:#5a4638}
    .res-name{margin-left:auto;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}
    .res-dep{flex:none;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;color:#7a5a12;background:#fbefd2;border-radius:999px;padding:3px 9px}
    .board-note{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:13px;line-height:1.45}

    footer{text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);padding:30px 0 40px}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="agentbar">
    <span class="tag">🤖 For agents</span>
    <span>Agents &amp; AI assistants — <a href="/.well-known/kiosk.json">learn here</a> how to work with this site.</span>
    <a class="what" href="https://kiosk.tech">(what is this?)</a>
  </div>
  <header>
    <div class="logo">atable<span>for</span></div>
    <nav>
      <a href="/reservations">Reservations board</a>
      <% if user_signed_in? %>
        <span class="whoami">Staff: <%= current_user.display_name.presence || current_user.email %></span>
        <%= button_to "Sign out", destroy_user_session_path, method: :delete, class: "signout-btn" %>
      <% else %>
        <a class="staff-login" href="/users/sign_in">Staff login</a>
      <% end %>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <!-- ── 0. PROTOCOL-PRIMARY banner: this is a machine endpoint, not a web form ── -->
  <section class="proto">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="proto-badge">🔌 This endpoint speaks Kiosk</span>
      <h1>Point your AI assistant here — it books the table.</h1>
      <p>This is <strong>atablefor</strong> — a restaurant booking aggregator across a handful of Lisbon neighbourhoods (Alfama, Graça, Bairro Alto, Belém, Príncipe Real) — exposed as a <strong>Kiosk</strong> booking endpoint. There is <strong>no web booking form and no human sign-in to reserve</strong> — an assistant discovers the surface, registers itself, and books a table over the protocol.</p>
      <p class="say">“Book a table for two in Alfama tonight at 8.”</p>
      <p class="no-signin">Say that to your assistant. It reads <a href="/.well-known/kiosk.json" style="color:#ffcf9b">/.well-known/kiosk.json</a>, self-registers, and reserves — no login, no app, no card. (Staff sign-in, top right, is only for restaurant staff to manage linked diners.)</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="wrap">

    <!-- ── 1. How an assistant books here ────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="sec">
      <div class="sec-k">🤖 How an assistant books here — over the protocol</div>
      <div class="tryit">
        <h2>Book a table — no human at the keyboard</h2>
        <p>Give the one-line prompt to your AI assistant. Behind the scenes it:</p>
        <ol class="steps">
          <li>Discovers this endpoint via <code style="font-size:13px">/.well-known/kiosk.json</code> — no <code style="font-size:13px">/bookings</code> web page, no browser login.</li>
          <li>Registers itself with a proof-of-possession handshake (creates its own account).</li>
          <li>Calls <code style="font-size:13px">query availability</code>, then <code style="font-size:13px">run book_table</code> — the reservation is confirmed.</li>
        </ol>
        <p class="note">⚠ This demo runs <strong>production-grade proof-of-work</strong> (~9–10&nbsp;s per register on an M-series laptop core) on purpose — so you can feel the real anti-scalping toll first-hand. The other Kiosk demos are tuned light (sub-second) for quick poking.</p>
        <div class="linkbox">
          <strong>Link a booking to a real diner account.</strong> A diner signs in at <a href="/users/sign_in">Staff login</a> (demo login below), opens <a href="/kiosk/auth/assistants">Manage&nbsp;assistants</a> and mints a one-time link code. Hand that code to the assistant — it redeems the code over the wire, and its bookings then appear on the <a href="/reservations">reservations board</a> under that diner's name.
          <div class="cred">Demo login: <code>diego@example.com</code> &nbsp;/&nbsp; <code>atablefor-demo-password</code></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── 2. The live reservations board (the reveal) ───────────────── -->
    <section class="sec">
      <div class="sec-k">📋 Live reservations board — see the booking land</div>
      <%= render "board" %>
    </section>

    <!-- ── 3. About this demo ────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="sec">
      <div class="sec-k">About this demo</div>
      <div class="about">
        <p><strong>atablefor</strong> is a restaurant-booking aggregator (a handful of coined Lisbon restaurants, each with a few finite tables) and the <strong>human↔assistant account-linking</strong> reference: a diner signs in, mints a link code, their assistant redeems it, and the assistant's bookings tie to the diner's account — visible on the board above — all with <strong>no money on the wire</strong> (a reservation takes no card; any € figure is a no-show hold settled at the restaurant). Tables are finite: a fully-booked seating is honestly sold out.</p>
        <div class="chips">
          <span class="chip">🔗 Human↔assistant linking</span>
          <span class="chip">Viewable reservations board</span>
          <span class="chip">No payment (EUR holds only)</span>
          <span class="chip">Production-grade PoW (~10&nbsp;s, M-series core)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="links">
          <a href="https://github.com/kiosk-hq/kiosk/tree/main/kiosk-demo-atablefor">▶ Source on GitHub</a>
          <a href="https://kiosk.tech">What is Kiosk? →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── 4. Live activity (compact) ────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="sec">
      <div class="sec-k">Live activity</div>
      <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat"><div class="n"><%= @tables_booked %></div><div class="l">Tables booked</div></div>
        <div class="stat"><div class="n"><%= @covers_seated %></div><div class="l">Covers seated</div></div>
        <div class="stat"><div class="n"><%= @reservations.size %></div><div class="l">Upcoming</div></div>
        <div class="stat"><div class="n"><%= @restaurants %></div><div class="l">Restaurants</div></div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>

  <footer>atablefor — demo provider — powered by <a href="https://kiosk.tech">Kiosk</a></footer>
</body>
</html>
